const blocks = [["Week 1","Find a controlled starting variation","Choose a bar and grip. Use assistance if needed. Record a manageable hold rather than chasing a maximum."],["Week 2","Repeat the conditions","Use the same assistance and settings. Record each session. Keep the hold shorter if control deteriorates."],["Week 3","Review one variable","If the sessions remain comfortable, consider a small change to hold time. Keep the other settings stable. Repeating the previous week is also a valid choice."],["Week 4","Compare like with like","Compare your recorded holds using the same assistance and bar. Decide whether to repeat the block or adjust your next goal."]];
